      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat already has a system of making avatars available to someone else which is their integration with readyplayer.me.\n\nI obviously have no idea how it works internally and it's probably purpose-built for that very platform, but I'd imagine that it should be possible to have a similar system for commissioned content.",
