      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something like this would help hugely for the RP community I am apart of where in the past the public models for certain units were taken down in spite in a way to cause drama, fortunately we were able to create replacement models for players to use.\n\nWe've wanted to create a dedicated account(/s) for our public models to be uploaded to so we can avoid the repeat of the past bad actors however with no way to easily upload to the account securely (without the creators handing the files over which we do not want to force to do so) we could easily run into a worse solution were 1 person could delete it all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
