  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For people who commission models, a lot of times avatars are uploaded to the clients accounts directly. But this requires giving out your login info, once is enough for me, whether i trust the commissioner or not, and even more so if you commission multiple people. \n\nAlso applies to just any general situation. EX: friends wants to upload whatever model to my account.\n\nMy Proposal is to allow the client to generate a one time use access key to make uploads to their account. :)\nCould be generated via the vrchat website.",
